Wire codex ingress + auto-turn dispatcher into the live 'c2c start codex' app-server session supervisor (turnkey E2E). P1 built+proved C2c_codex_ingress (T003) and C2c_codex_autoturn (T007) as modules + soak-tested via standalone dogfood harnesses, but NO production code drives them: c2c start codex launches the app-server+TUI (T006) yet never runs the inject/auto-turn loop. Needs: supervisor loop in the c2c start codex managed path that starts the ingress+autoturn dispatcher against the session's authenticated app-server, lifecycle-bound (starts on attach, stops on TUI exit), + a live E2E driven by REAL 'c2c start codex' (not a harness).
